<title>USA: Greyhound Lines April passenger sales rise.</title>
<headline>Greyhound Lines April passenger sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in 000's except where noted)</p>
<p> 198 Locations		  Apr 1997	 Apr 1996    Change</p>
<p> Passengers			  1,023	    1,003	2.0%</p>
<p> Passenger Sales		 $33,708	  $32,527	3.6%</p>
<p> Passenger Miles		 382,404	  347,865	9.9%</p>
<p>Yield (Sales per Passenger Mile)</p>
<p>  (cents)			     8.81	     9.35    (5.8)%</p>
<p> Average Trip Length (miles)     374		347	7.8%</p>
