<p> Regular Service Miles	  20,560	   18,913	8.7%</p>
<p> Available Seat Miles	  945,760	  869,998	8.7%</p>
<p>		  MARCH/APRIL TRAFFIC STATISTICS</p>
<p>		   (in 000's except where noted)</p>
<p> 198 Locations	    March/April '97 March/April '96 Change</p>
